Microsoft 365
 Stay connected and organized with family and friends.
 

https://click.mail.onedrive.com/?qs=8f02b57013fa9fecc4d266feef231b24b7e71e3a7017fcbca26383750936788a01a699e6ad3a547f65d74a6573489c9f953bfbdb26b401970a82242c25522b3e 

Get personal with Microsoft Teams
 

 Thank you for downloading Microsoft Teams. Stay connected across your life in the Teams mobile and desktop app. New features are now available for preview. Check out some easy tips below to help you get started.
 

Start a conversation

 
 

Start video calls, create new group chats, and share tasks<sup style="line-height: 0px; font-size: 70%;">*</sup>, photos, GIFs<sup style="line-height: 0px; font-size: 70%;">*</sup>, and more.

https://click.mail.onedrive.com/?qs=8f02b57013fa9fec117f3f11f527f47e231225fc3bbfb77e50dd3c18973e4aacf60d40b24a20798d84d600f1b04c0672c42ad139aad3bf5f92bc63e04a17ce81 

