Learn how to create and share tasks<sup style="line-height: 0px; font-size: 70%;">*</sup> 

Spread the word

 
 

The more the merrier. Get your family and friends on Teams so everyone can stay in the loop. 

https://click.mail.onedrive.com/?qs=8f02b57013fa9fec1966f03bf74bf189d3fad9adaf0be2b59f315c8c82e5d3dfb74ccb98c47ee43c0a094fda53a3354cd870c91e969dc9f19bf99131eebe448e 

Learn how to invite your friends and family

Store important info with Safe*

 
 

With Safe, you can securely store confidential information like passwords, rewards numbers, or login information and share it with others within Teams. 

https://click.mail.onedrive.com/?qs=8f02b57013fa9fec16274b1d0aa0c700974d08c6b1601a21c5e5a65f0497772712d4f56989858041dbc436ecf66a16a1a7c4c682585ff6e3e7569236e0c3742d 

Learn how to get started with Safe<sup style="line-height: 0px; font-size: 70%;">*</sup>

Share your location*

 
 

Keep your friends and family in the know with location sharing on Teams. 

https://click.mail.onedrive.com/?qs=8f02b57013fa9fec912bbfb3dc172e7d591e5f110e2c8d9a980a9f00601e89581d6f403ccc7d49f948ed99572622c78d9ae40e8581d26d8214d114278f72bc7b 

Learn how to share your location<sup style="line-height: 0px; font-size: 70%;">*</sup>

